  <section class="section shell content-columns">
    <div><p class="eyebrow">PROJECT-REPORTED PROGRESS</p><h2>70% estimated</h2><p class="content-copy">The project currently reports an estimated 70% development progress. This is an internal project estimate, not an independently measured completion metric and not a statement that Aurora OS is ready for installation or production use.</p><p class="eyebrow">PUBLIC EVIDENCE STATUS</p><h3>Not verified</h3><p class="content-copy">The website has not independently reviewed the OS source repository or a consolidated test report. Individual subsystem capabilities must be assessed against implementation and test evidence.</p></div>
    <div><p class="eyebrow">ENGINEERING AREAS</p><ul class="content-list"><li>System and kernel architecture</li><li>User-space and service boundaries</li><li>Capability and security model</li><li>Storage and package lifecycle</li><li>Hardware support and verification reports</li></ul></div>
